@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant ":System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : asks to create a map
    activate System

        System --> Editor : receives the request and asks for a size and a name
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : types a size and a name
    activate System

        System --> Editor : receives and validates the name and the size
        System --> Editor : creates the map and displays operation success
    deactivate System


@enduml